<title>UK: BADMINTON-ALL ENGLAND CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS. [CORRECTED 08:54 GMT]</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-ALL ENGLAND CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS. [CORRECTED 08:54 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the All England badminton championships (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Played on Wednesday (corrects from Thursday):</p>
<p>Women's singles, third round:</p>
<p>Dai Yun beat 1-Mia Audina (Indonesia) 6-11 11-8 11-5</p>
<p>5/8-Zhang Ning (China) beat Marina Andrievskaya (Sweden) 12-11</p>
<p>11-5</p>
<p>3/4-Ya Zhaoying (China) beat Kanako Yonekura 11-7 11-0</p>
<p>5/8-Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) beat Yao Yan (China) 5-11 11-7</p>
<p>11-8</p>
<p>Ra Kyung-min (South Korera) beat 5/8-Wang Chen (China) 11-4</p>
<p>11-6</p>
<p>3/4-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat Han Jingna (China)  11-3 12-9</p>
<p>5/8-Suzi Susanti (Indonesia) beat Park Jin-hyun (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-1 11-2</p>
<p>2-Gong Zhichao (China) beat Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea) 11-2</p>
<p>11-3</p>
</text>
